  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "For the two positive numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></math>, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math> are in a geometric progression, while <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> are in an arithmetic progression, then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>b</mi></math> is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;are in GP, so</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;are in A.P., so</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>360</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>360</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>18</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>324</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1440</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>720</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1764</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>720</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>144</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
